  "details": "There is what is called a gust of wind effected expression.\nUp to now, it has been expressed by directly hitting the collider, but it consumes the collider inexhaustibly.\nBy using the ForceArea collider, it behaves as if gravity is generated on the set vector while the PhyBones are swinging in that area.\nIf this feature becomes available, it will be easier to use PhysBone in future worlds to express hair and skirts that sway in the breeze, influenced by the wind in the world....",
